{"savedAt":"2026-11-04T18:46:22.153Z","id":"d3227004-224e-4542-be19-60f8cb7ea292","slug":"how-to-become-a-ca","title":"How To Become a CA?","excerpt":"Becoming a Chartered Accountant (CA) is a prestigious and challenging journey that requires dedication, hard work, and perseverance. This...","seoData":{"tags":[{"type":"meta","props":{"property":"og:image","content":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/afb999_0adbf6fdccec48ac920bc091108e4094~mv2.jpg"},"meta":{"width":1024,"height":983},"children":"","custom":false,"disabled":false},{"type":"title","children":"How To Become a CA? Step by Step Guide","custom":false,"disabled":false},{"type":"meta","props":{"name":"description","content":"Embark on a prestigious journey to become a Chartered Accountant (CA). Learn the step-by-step process, eligibility criteria, and career prospects."},"children":"","custom":false,"disabled":false}],"settings":{"preventAutoRedirect":false,"keywords":[]}},"richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"b6786170","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Becoming a Chartered Accountant (CA) is a prestigious and challenging journey that requires dedication, hard work, and perseverance. This comprehensive guide will walk you through the step-by-step process of becoming a CA, from eligibility criteria to the final exam. We will also discuss the career prospects and opportunities available to CAs.","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"rgb(31, 31, 31)"}}]}}],"style":{},"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"cqiob436","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"uq3w5435","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"custom":"596"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"afb999_8632524fd2b54ed2b384a57cefc08999~mv2.webp"},"width":1024,"height":1024},"disableExpand":true,"altText":"Chartered Accountant","disableDownload":true}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9i6wj437","nodes":[],"parag